    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A Turek Orc leader praised for his powerful soul, bravery, and wisdom. He has retired from the field, and lives in a secluded corner of the Orc Barracks giving counsel to those who seek his advice. Normally reserved, when roused he does not shy away from battle. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
